{"id":21031,"name":"Clay County","slug":"clay-county","state":"Florida","code":"FL","program":null,"sourceUrl":"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/hybrid/hybrid-tax-sales-states/florida-tax-lien-deeds-18-potential-return/clay-county/","lastUpdated":"2025-05-26T03:03:08","facts":{"redemptionPeriod":"Up to 2 years","extra":[{"label":"Auction Type","value":"Online (Lien, not property)"},{"label":"Website","value":"Clay County Tax Liens"},{"label":"Held By","value":"Clay County Tax Collector"},{"label":"Auction Time","value":"Late May to Early June"},{"label":"Interest Rate Starts At","value":"18%"},{"label":"Bidding Style","value":"Bid down the interest rate"},{"label":"Deposit Required?","value":"No (but pre-registration needed)"},{"label":"Balance Due","value":"N/A"},{"label":"Surplus Funds","value":"No"}]},"bodyHtml":"\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed aligncenter is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://youtu.be/Zv02JfECVLE?si=RG_koT4Ofa__NQoj\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://success.taxlienschool.com/abcs-free-2?el=tls-vault-county-blog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Get Dustin Hahn’s Tax Lien and Deed FREE Mini-Course</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Buying Property Through Tax Auctions in Clay County, Florida</h2>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Your simple guide to tax lien certificates and tax deed auctions</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>If you’re looking to earn interest or possibly buy real estate through tax sales, Clay County, Florida, has a system that’s worth checking out. They offer both <strong>tax lien certificates</strong> and <strong>tax deed auctions</strong>, giving investors two different ways to get involved.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Let’s break it all down in plain English.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How It Works: From Tax Liens to Tax Deeds</h3>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Tax Lien Certificate Sales</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>Each year, if someone doesn’t pay their property taxes by <strong>April 1</strong>, Clay County adds a <strong>3% penalty</strong>. If it’s still unpaid by <strong>April 30</strong>, the property gets listed for auction.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>By <strong>late May or early June</strong>, the county holds an <a href=\"https://www.claycountytax.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">online tax certificate auction</mark></a>. You don’t buy the property—you’re buying a <strong>lien</strong> on it. You’ll bid by offering the <strong>lowest interest rate</strong> you’re willing to accept (starts at <strong>18%</strong>), and if the owner pays it back, you get that interest.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>If they don’t pay within <strong>2 years</strong>, you can apply for a <strong>tax deed</strong>, which could eventually lead to owning the property.</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Tax Deed Sales</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>Once a tax deed is requested, the <a href=\"https://www.clayclerk.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Clerk of Court</mark></a> holds another online auction. This time, you <strong>are bidding to own the property</strong>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Opening bids include all back taxes, interest, and fees. Properties are sold <strong>as-is</strong>, and you must do your own research before bidding.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Clay County Tax Sale Info Table</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Key Things to Know Before You Bid</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Registration is required</strong> for both types of auctions.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Deposits</strong> may be needed for tax deed sales.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Do your <strong>due diligence</strong>—research properties, check for liens, and know what you’re bidding on.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Property is sold <strong>as-is</strong> with no guarantees.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Where to Find Auctions and Updates</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.claycountytax.com/property_taxes/delinquent_taxes.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Tax Lien Auctions</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.clayclerk.com/departments/tax-deeds/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Tax Deed Auctions</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://clay.realtaxdeed.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Live Bidding Portal (RealAuction)</mark></a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Clay-County-Courthouse-Florida.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Clay-County-Courthouse-Florida-541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Clay-County-Courthouse-Florida-296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Clay-County-Courthouse-Florida-768x512.webp 768w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Clay-County-Courthouse-Florida-20x13.webp 20w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Clay-County-Courthouse-Florida-32x21.webp 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Clay-County-Courthouse-Florida.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1081\" srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Clay-County-Courthouse-Florida.png 1081w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Clay-County-Courthouse-Florida-541x360.png 541w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Clay-County-Courthouse-Florida-296x197.png 296w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Clay-County-Courthouse-Florida-768x512.png 768w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Clay-County-Courthouse-Florida-20x13.png 20w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Clay-County-Courthouse-Florida-32x21.png 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" class=\"wp-image-21035 sp-no-webp\" alt=\"Clay County Courthouse Florida\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"  > </picture></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--1\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://success.taxlienschool.com/start-here-tfb?el=tls-vault-county-blog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Book a Call with Dustin Hahn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Contact Info</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><thead><tr><th>Office</th><th>Contact Details</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Clay County Clerk – Tax Deeds</strong></td><td>Email: <a class=\"\"></a><a href=\"mailto:taxdeedinfo@clayclerk.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">info@clayclerk.com</mark></a><br>Phone: (904) 529-4221<br><a href=\"https://www.clayclerk.com/departments/tax-deeds/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Visit Website</mark></a></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Clay County Tax Collector – Certificates</strong></td><td>Email: <a class=\"\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">dhutchings@claycountytax.com</mark></a><br>Phone: (904) 269-6320<br><a class=\"\" href=\"https://www.claycountytax.com\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Visit </mark></a><a href=\"https://www.claycountytax.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Website</mark></a></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Why Investors Like Clay County</h3>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Affordable Suburban Market</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>Located just southwest of Jacksonville, Clay County offers more space at lower prices—perfect for investors priced out of the city.</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Strong Military Rental Demand</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>Thanks to nearby <strong>Naval Air Station Jacksonville</strong>, there&#8217;s a constant demand for rental homes, especially in towns like <strong>Orange Park</strong> and <strong>Middleburg</strong>.</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Growing Population</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>Rapid growth is fueling new housing, schools, and businesses, especially in places like <strong>Fleming Island</strong> and <strong>Oakleaf</strong>.</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Nature and Waterfront Lots</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>Access to <strong>St. Johns River</strong>, <strong>Black Creek</strong>, and plenty of parks makes land here attractive for both buyers and investors.</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Active Auction Scene</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>Frequent <a href=\"https://clay.realtaxdeed.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">tax deed auctions</mark></a> and <a href=\"https://clayclerk.com/departments/recording/tax-deeds/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">surplus land sales</mark></a> give you chances to grab residential lots or wooded land at low prices.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">FAQs – Tax Deed &amp; Lien Sales in Clay County</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Can anyone bid on these auctions?</strong><br>Yes. Both local and out-of-state investors are welcome, including international buyers.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Is the title clear after a tax deed sale?</strong><br>Not always. You may need to file a <strong>quiet title action</strong> to clear any claims.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Are there risks involved?</strong><br>Yes. If you skip due diligence, you might end up with unusable land or properties with liens or code violations.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>What if the property sells for more than the taxes owed?</strong><br>That extra money (called <strong>surplus funds</strong>) can be claimed by the former owner or lienholders.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>How do I check which properties are for sale?</strong><br>Visit the <a href=\"https://clay.realtaxdeed.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">RealAuction portal</mark></a> or the <a href=\"https://www.clayclerk.com/departments/tax-deeds/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Clerk’s auction calendar</mark></a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Pro Tips for Success</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Don’t wait till the last minute to register or deposit funds.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Use parcel numbers to research properties across county databases.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Always double-check auction dates and times—they can change.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Budget for extra costs like recording fees and legal steps post-auction.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Useful Links</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.clayclerk.com/departments/tax-deeds/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Clay County Clerk – Tax Deeds</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.claycountytax.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Tax Collector – Tax Certificates</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://clay.realtaxdeed.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">RealAuction Clay County Portal</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.claycountygov.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Clay County Government Site</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/hybrid/hybrid-tax-sales-states/florida-tax-lien-deeds-18-potential-return/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Comprehensive Guide to Florida’s Deed Auction Process and Key Requirements</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/hybrid/hybrid-investing-overview/understanding-hybrid-tax-sale/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Discover the intriguing world of Hybrid Auctions</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://youtu.be/ES5ZPyHRFMM?si=EmzhADUvwB_2FAAr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Discover Tax Deeds and how you can find property for as little as $50!&nbsp;</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://youtu.be/eNKIUQC6io0?si=b31MOzg-xCeQzAUA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Want to get started with Tax Liens? Watch this video!</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://youtu.be/57fvEHg8e1o?si=NjyDVCGrnXBpyygc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Explore the lucrative world of Florida Tax Liens and Deeds</mark></a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Final Thoughts</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Clay County, Florida, gives investors a solid mix of tax lien and deed opportunities. With its growing market, rental demand, and online access to auctions, it’s a smart place to consider.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>But always do your homework before you buy. Tax deed and lien investing can be rewarding, but the key to success is knowing the rules, the risks, and the real value of what you’re buying</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-need-a-hand\"><strong>Need A Hand?</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Review the <span style=\"color: #0693e3;\"><a style=\"color: #0693e3;\" href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/general-auction-calendar/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Auction Calendar</a></span> for more upcoming sales . Don’t miss out on the chance to participate and discover new opportunities. If you’re unfamiliar with the process or need guidance, consider <span style=\"color: #0693e3;\"><a href=\"https://success.taxlienschool.com/start-here-tfb?el=tls-vault-county-blog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">booking a call</mark></a></span> with us so we can help you through each step. Additionally, explore <span style=\"color: #0693e3;\"><a href=\"https://success.taxlienschool.com/abcs-free-2?el=tls-vault-county-blog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">free online resources</mark></a></span> to expand your knowledge and enhance your investment strategies</p>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n<p><em>Sign up or log in to view the full content.</em></p><div id=\"popup-overlay\"></div><div id=\"signup-popup\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 20px;\"><h4>Get Instant Free Access To The Training Vault Now</h4><p>Learn how to get 18-36% returns on your investment and buy property for as little as $500 with tax lien and tax deeds.</p><div class=\"video-container\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; margin: 20px 0;\"><iframe src=\"https://youtube.com/embed/FkB-M8RaSHo\" allowfullscreen style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 560px; height: 315px; border: none; border-radius: 8px;\"></iframe></div><div class=\"button-container\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\"><button style=\"padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Sign Up for FREE Access</button><button style=\"padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Already a Member? Login</button></div></div>","upcomingCount":0}